Source: pg-duckdb
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: <mdb@yandex-team.ru>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10), postgresql-server-dev-all (>= 195~),
 cmake, ninja-build, g++, pkg-config,
 libcurl4-openssl-dev, libssl-dev, libstdc++-12-dev
Standards-Version: 1.1-0
Homepage: https://github.com/duckdb/pg_duckdb

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-duckdb
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, postgresql-PGVERSION,
 libcurl4, libstdc++6
Description: DuckDB embedded analytics engine for PostgreSQL
 pg_duckdb embeds DuckDB into PostgreSQL, enabling fast analytical queries
 over local tables and remote object storage (S3, GCS, Azure).
